# Q05e0edc927c5

```modelica
model Base
  parameter Real n;
  parameter Real bias = 1;
  parameter Real score = n + bias;
end Base;

model ImplA
  extends Base;
  parameter Real extra = 2;
end ImplA;

model ImplB
  extends Base;
  parameter Real extra = 4;
end ImplB;

model Holder
  replaceable ImplA comp constrainedby Base(n = 5);
end Holder;

model Study
  extends Holder(redeclare ImplA comp(extra = 7));
  parameter Real result = comp.score;
end Study;
```

What is the exact value of Study.result? Return an integer or a reduced fraction.
